Name Rio Note - Chaos #3 Exterminators Niteroi

Interactability_Text_Line_0 The museum should be closed for visitors, make sure to disguise as employees in order to deploy the beacon without arousing suspicion. Make sure to keep a low profile during departure.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Gamma will be providing you with safe haven upon arrival to Magé. If questioned, claim to be tourists.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 May the ZPD fall!